Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.89,0:03:39.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:45.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:56.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再有点牛排就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only we had some cab'.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.93,0:00:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闺蜜之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls' night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们又狂躁起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys are getting restless again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:17.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没告诉过我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still haven't told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪发现它们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:23.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们袭击你  还是你专门捕获它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they attack? Did you hunt them down?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识它们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or did you know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:35.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.98,0:01:37.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:44.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想谈这事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:56.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:02:00.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}They deserved what they got.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:06.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们生前也不是什么好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't human to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你去拿点五零口径机枪  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You, grab the .50. - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.55,0:04:00.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督要带这么多枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Governor wants all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他希望有更多选择  -他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He wants options. - Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:05.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:08.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-去多少人  -所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many are going out? - Everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.69,0:04:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为他们达成协议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought there was a deal on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.27,0:04:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信这只是防备措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it's just a precaution,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,展示我们的武力\N{\fnArial\fs30}a show of force.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:00.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:01.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:07.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:12.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.11,0:05:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的工作室\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my workshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那对伍德伯里毫无帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that help Woodbury?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:21.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:23.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这本该是一个新起点\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was supposed to be a new start,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.22,0:05:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之前谈过的那些事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about everything we talked about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克服困难  重振文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beating this thing? Clawing our way back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.11,0:05:33.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和米琼恩的恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this business with Michonne,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.36,0:05:34.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:37.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是监狱里的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the people at the prison...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:38.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.28,0:05:43.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我应该释怀吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should move on? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.81,0:05:45.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切结束之后  我会释怀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I will as soon as this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.77,0:05:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-菲利普  -我问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Philip-- - Let me ask you something, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:52.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还相信行尸是有意识的对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you still believe the biters have some spark in them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道他们自己是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of who they were?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.91,0:05:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那死的就是我女儿  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then that was my daughter, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:01.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是不是佩妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether that was Penny or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,木已成舟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:07.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:12.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说  这才最重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.05,0:06:21.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有什么协议  菲利普想要米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no deal. Philip's asked for Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.99,0:06:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克不会同意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick would never agree to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:25.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管他交不交出她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether he hands her over or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他都会把他们都杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gonna kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我得阻止这一切  -我觉得你办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to stop this. - I don't think you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.85,0:07:08.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:11.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉监狱里的人赶紧离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the people at the prison to get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.27,0:07:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间会冲淡他的仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}In time, he'll move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.52,0:07:15.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:18.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:20.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你接近不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never get close to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会先开枪杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll gun you down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:24.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们对我没有防备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if they see me coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:27.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米尔顿  这太变态了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton, this is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:30.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just stand back and watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.45,0:08:51.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么还保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you still protect him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:08:53.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他根本不在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't give a shit about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在菲利普成为总督前我就认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Philip before he became the governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.11,0:08:58.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他本性未变\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man still exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:00.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:02.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  假设你杀了总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so you kill the governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:05.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你又被枪杀了  然后马丁内斯接管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you get shot and Martinez takes over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.31,0:09:06.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.74,0:09:10.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了总督也救不了你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing the governor doesn't save your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就得回去  提醒他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I have to go back. Warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能离开伍德伯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't leave Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:21.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想参与这场屠杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want to be a part of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监狱里我谁也不认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know anyone at the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:26.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样  你认识莫尔  他就待得挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? You know Merle. He fit in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:28.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你喜不喜欢  我属于这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it or not, I belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.19,0:09:36.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then if you stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:40.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不能让别人看出你有异心\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't keep looking the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.34,0:09:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:01.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有其它的武器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any other weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:13.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还有子弹吗  你们还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}D'you have more rounds? What do you guys got?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:17.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督要收缴所有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Governor wants all weapons collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要给部队全副武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to get the team geared up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:26.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我武装起来更有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm more helpful armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.05,0:10:28.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的武器和弹药都交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand over your piece and any ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.17,0:10:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:31.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别犯傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not be stupid about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:33.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交出你的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand over your piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.23,0:10:42.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有刀子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:44.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要搜我的身吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to frisk me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.02,0:10:52.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本该告诉你这一切的  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have told you about all this. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.08,0:10:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想把你也搅合进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to keep you separate from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:11:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全  你懂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.25,0:11:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.42,0:11:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:06.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以帮忙  明天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can. Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:10.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你和我们一起去见瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you with us when we go and meet Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.55,0:11:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他轻举妄动  你可以劝他理智些\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tries anything, you can talk some sense into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.34,0:11:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轻举妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tries anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:16.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你相信他们  我可不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you trust them, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:21.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.66,0:11:33.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个行尸交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:36.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该多练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need the practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:45.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:48.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在旁边一直啰嗦  让我怎么放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I gonna relax if you keep telling me to relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:55.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-要不你来  -我早练过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to do this? - I have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.45,0:12:03.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在浪费弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:16.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.61,0:12:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:25.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一大波行尸正在向主墙进发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, large pack of walkers was spotted heading for the main wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:29.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁内斯需要支援  我来守着这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martinez wants some help. I got this covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能擅离岗哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not supposed to leave this post.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问马丁内斯吧  我只是奉命行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask Martinez. I'm just doing what I'm told.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:35.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得把他带过来  我们得听他的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to bring him over. We need to hear it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是在浪费时间  -你怎么不去帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're wasting time. - Why can't you handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.62,0:12:39.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个神枪手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be a good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.71,0:12:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你在干什么  -我必须从这里出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.05,0:12:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没人离开  -求你了  我不想惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody leaves. - Please, I don't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:51.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-到底是怎么回事  -别挡我的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this about? - Just get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:55.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-松手  -放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't. - Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要互相伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's got to get hurt here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.21,0:13:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, it's just this place is--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没办法待在这里  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't stay here. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.17,0:13:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督  他表里不一\N{\fnArial\fs30}The governor, he is not what he seems to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:12.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我们挺坦诚的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems pretty straight up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前也那么以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I thought, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我告诉你  他干过很卑鄙的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm telling you, he has done terrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.19,0:13:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还在计划着更坏的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's planning worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得赶紧离开这里  劝你们也快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to get out of here and you should, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太累了  头脑不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're rattled, exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.67,0:13:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把刀放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just put the knife down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不应该放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't have let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能怎么办  打死她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to do, shoot her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你应该阻止她  -怎么阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should have stopped her. - Stop her how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:06.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从背后开枪打死她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot her in the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你们做的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.03,0:14:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好你们俩没受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank god neither of you were hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.44,0:14:11.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们守在墙上阻止行尸进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stand on that wall to stop biters,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是阻止人们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}not keep people in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里不是某种集中营吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a prison camp, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是  只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not. It's just
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没能力照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's in no shape to take care of herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得她完全有能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems pretty capable to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.10,0:14:26.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在外面待了一整个冬天\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was out there all winter
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,独自一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.53,0:14:32.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能想象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:38.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个人有彼此  以及朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you two had each other or your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.43,0:14:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而她身边只有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}She only had the biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:46.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们带她回来帮助她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We brought her in and tried to help her,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.01,0:14:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.21,0:14:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面已经改变了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd been out there too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她...  说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she-- did she say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.47,0:15:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你指哪方面  -我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like what? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.89,0:15:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如是什么让她感到恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what panicked her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.98,0:15:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望这不会影响到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope this doesn't affect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:15.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.85,0:15:19.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们听说她以前和监狱的人是一伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we heard she was with that prison group.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望没添什么麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I didn't complicate things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:27.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, look, I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.91,0:15:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁内斯这儿需要点助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martinez here could use a hand with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.92,0:15:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们不介意的话就帮帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wouldn't mind helping him out,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.52,0:15:32.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会非常感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-当然  -谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:48.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:52.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们去追了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They going after her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.31,0:15:56.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有意见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a problem with that, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让她走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她只想和她那伙人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just wants to be with her people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:15.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩谈过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talked to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.95,0:16:18.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.47,0:16:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道她要走  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew she was leaving, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还谈了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else did you two talk about, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:32.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把协议的事告诉她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell her about the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.27,0:16:36.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把米琼恩的事告诉她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell her about Michonne?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她知道了  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好  一会儿出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be ready to roll in a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.55,0:17:13.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是去追那个姑娘  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going after that girl, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是呢  有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we were? Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她情绪很激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was pretty shook up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然  她不想在这里待下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She definitely didn't want to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  让她自生自灭吧  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, she's on her own, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:24.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一言难尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sort of hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟后去卡车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be at the truck in five.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.79,0:17:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  -哪个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - What girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.69,0:17:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚翻墙走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea jumped the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.54,0:17:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你们眼皮底下吗  你们就放她走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your watch? And you let her go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  这些人一直在谈论她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, these guys have been talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.03,0:17:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是个麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.53,0:17:42.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许问题不在她那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she's not the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说了些很疯狂的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said some pretty crazy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么吗  因为她疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why? 'cause she's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们好不容易留下  别搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't screw this up for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我只是警惕而已  -你们俩警惕去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just looking out. - For you two, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.68,0:17:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里过得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a good thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想因为你被赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to get tossed out because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.57,0:18:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这帮家伙紧张不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys are on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们被那个疯牛仔还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been attacked by that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.81,0:18:09.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个拿刀的娘们给袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}crazy-ass cowboy and some chick with a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.41,0:18:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上要发生大事  你却在捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit's going down and you're making waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:13.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只要乖乖守本分就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to get with the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.25,0:18:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很守本分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙不信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy doesn't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:20.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别害了大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not screw this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.01,0:18:21.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退后  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ease back, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不退怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:28.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又想当着我儿子的面羞辱我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to shame me in front of my boy again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  别挑那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go there, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.92,0:18:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,堂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donna...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是碰巧在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just happened to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谁都有可能  -但偏偏不是别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It could have been anyone. - But it wasn't, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:41.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是你  -你们非要这时候吵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was you. - You want to do this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.39,0:18:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就想说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long time coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:46.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  就是我  我救了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was me. I saved her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:56.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在正确的地点  正确的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right place, right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:59.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那时起  她就像流浪狗一样死死跟着你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from that moment, she was glued to you like a lost puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你成了她的黑马王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her knight in shining armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:04.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这让我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It made me feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.34,0:19:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我也能救她  -我知道你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I could have done it. - I know you could've.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-可她不知道  -她当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She didn't. - Of course she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:13.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她心里明白  她只是害怕而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knew that. She was just scared, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你救还是我救的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't got nothing to do with you or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩  快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, I said five.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走了  发动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Fire it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事儿还没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.57,0:20:48.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.79,0:21:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  这是好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackpot, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:07.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是要搞人道毁灭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This some kind of extermination?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.64,0:21:10.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以这么说吧  今天不杀行尸  香珀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could say that. No weeding out today, Shump.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:12.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-越多越好  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The more the merrier. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:14.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们拿它们有用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a use for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.55,0:21:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  任何东西我们都有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, we got a use for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:21.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This got something to do with
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.97,0:21:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟监狱那帮人的会议准备的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that meeting tomorrow? The one with the prison group?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你  答对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ho, ho, ho. Get that man a prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.05,0:21:30.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们要带行尸去  -艾伦  接着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're bringing biters? - Allen, heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.36,0:21:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是太有才了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  把车上的项圈拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid, grab the collars out of the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.23,0:21:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.29,0:21:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  今儿别给咱找麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't think we were gonna have any problems today, fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.04,0:21:41.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不赞同拿人去喂行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think we'd be feeding people to biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.25,0:21:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在乎什么  不过是些行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you care? They're rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:45.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太变态了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.90,0:21:48.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搭把手啊  泰尔西  你聋了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, give me a hand here. Ty, you deaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:50.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.02,0:21:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那儿有妇女和儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got women and children.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.69,0:21:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.87,0:21:55.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那随你便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.86,0:21:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我们回去  你自己跟总督说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get back, you tell the governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.40,0:21:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定让你滚蛋  让你们全滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll send you packing. Send you all packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.84,0:22:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不必那样  该死  -放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no need for that. Dammit. - Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.57,0:22:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前我们都相互照应过来了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}We looked out for each other. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.96,0:22:05.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大不了再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:07.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们一意孤行  我们就离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get out of your way if that's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.95,0:22:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能代表我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't speak for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.95,0:22:11.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休想再让我的儿子出去送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not sending my boy out there again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我要关照他  -就像关照堂娜那样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I look out for him. - Like you looked out for Donna?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.64,0:22:21.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-泰尔西  -放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tyreese! - Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.15,0:22:23.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.56,0:22:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.14,0:22:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.24,0:22:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.93,0:22:44.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.42,0:22:52.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.92,0:22:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这是帮倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've all been very productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.38,0:23:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,香珀特  把他们带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shump, take 'em back to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.45,0:23:03.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只适合干针线活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let 'em do some knitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.46,0:28:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.49,0:28:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.22,0:28:16.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回伍德伯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back to woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.79,0:28:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.63,0:28:20.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大伙儿没你不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.93,0:28:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.66,0:28:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.53,0:28:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your town.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.08,0:28:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能就这样撒手不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just leave 'em all behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.20,0:28:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德利亚  拜托你回家吧  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Andrea, come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.62,0:28:58.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.70,0:33:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家时间到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to go home, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.74,0:33:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.95,0:37:51.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.11,0:37:54.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.19,0:37:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚得到消息  有人把坑里的行尸全烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got word. Someone barbecued the pit biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.89,0:37:58.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.67,0:38:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两颗耗子屎搅坏一锅汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a few shit stirrers in the bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.31,0:38:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰尔西和他姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese and his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.14,0:38:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们去仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send them over to distro.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.11,0:38:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-四人组都去  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rest of the group, too. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.99,0:38:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要行尸  再去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still gonna need biters, so get some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.02,0:38:10.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.78,0:38:22.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉让你们久等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.47,0:38:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.51,0:38:25.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.94,0:38:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差点自己都没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly made it back myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.90,0:38:32.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明天再去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll look again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.44,0:38:38.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你们在尸坑有点小争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I heard there was a little hang-up at the pits.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.32,0:38:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟瑞克有过节  我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a beef with Rick, that's fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.31,0:38:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不能把他的孩子们喂行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't be feeding his kids to biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.76,0:38:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人把谁喂行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's feeding anyone to biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.23,0:38:49.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到拖车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I saw the trailers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.24,0:38:51.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只是震慑战术  虚张声势\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a scare tactic. It's a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.48,0:38:56.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿把他们吓跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather scare his people into leaving us alone
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.25,0:38:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不愿交火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than engaging in another fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.31,0:39:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想拯救更多生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to save lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.80,0:39:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-只是做做样子  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're just for show? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.56,0:39:07.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起指在头上的枪  人们更害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, people are more afraid of a biter on a leash
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.74,0:39:09.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被拴住的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}than a gun in their face.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.25,0:39:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.71,0:39:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的手下为什么不直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why didn't your man just say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.88,0:39:20.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.35,0:39:23.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会和生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't discuss tactics with people
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.78,0:39:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,探讨战术策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.61,0:39:40.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Governor, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.94,0:39:43.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有时说话不经大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shoot my mouth off sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.73,0:39:46.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们真的很想留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the truth is we want to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.87,0:39:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我过激了  不会再发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw red. It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.58,0:39:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.60,0:40:10.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汽油你在哪找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get the gasoline?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.81,0:40:13.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.44,0:40:20.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.67,0:40:43.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.00,0:40:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.36,0:40:50.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.99,0:40:53.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从未如此之好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.40,0:40:59.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸坑被毁真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a real shame about the pits.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.82,0:41:03.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard about that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.87,0:41:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你能找出是谁做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you find out who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.41,0:41:10.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.76,0:42:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,